\pard\sl-240\slmult1 \cf1\lang1033\fs28\f0 Duck McCloud-The Fight Begins\fs24 \par
\cf2 Duck is on his way to San Francisco for his only holiday of the year, he hopes that nothing bad will happen on his holiday. Then disaster strikes .......\par
\cf1 \par
open breifcase\par
\cf2 Inside your breifcase there is a 9mm Walter PPK with suppresser and a picture of your wife,book and documents.\par
\cf1 \par
get gun\par
\cf2 you now have your trusty gun.\par
\cf1 \par
look at documents\par
\cf2 The document has a lot of information on my previous Bomb Defusing Mission. Under extreme pressure I managed to defuse the bomb by clipping the blue wire,( lucky i did not clip the red one).\par
\cf1 \par
look at bomb\par
\cf2 The bomb looks powerful and has many wires but from experiance you know it is either the red, blue,green or purple wire that you cut. But which is it now ?\par
\cf1 \par
cut blue wire\par
\cf2 Well done you have defused the bomb!!!!!. But while this was happening you hear gun shots from the front of the plane and you become suspicious. And you hear foot steps coming towards you. Do you hide or try to shoot them?\par
\cf1 \par
hide\par
\cf2 Good Idea, you hide behind your chair with your gun drawn luckily the guy does not see you, but you notice them talking about another bomb on the plane. And you realise you have to get off. But How?\par
\cf1 \par
east\par
\cf2 You move east.\par
It is a small passage, north is the cockpit south is the toilet. And in the corner is the boarding door.  You can move north and west.\par
\cf1 \par
north\par
\cf2 You move north.\par
Straight ahead of you are many dials which mean absolutly nothing to you.  In the Pilot and Co-Pilot chairs are two corpes. The pilot is a rather fat man and after closer inspection You see his badge which gave the name Elijah Manjula. In his forehead were two holes each gashing out the full 8 pints of blood and puss in his body. The Co-Pilot was identical except for he had a gunshot in his leg obviouly this man was asked to fly the plane but refused and got shot in the leg as punishment. He must have refused again and that is where the two gunshots to the head came from. On the back of the pilot you notice a parachute. You notice a glimmer of red light in the corner.Oh Crap!!! you cry. It is a second bomb.  Also here is second bomb 2 and your parachute.  You can only move south.\par
\cf1 \par
take parachute\par
\cf2 You have taken the parachute.\par
\cf1 \par
south\par
\cf2 You move south.\par
It is a small passage, north is the cockpit south is the toilet. And in the corner is the boarding door.  You can move north and west.\par
\cf1 \par
open door\par
\cf2 We need more force to open that door.\par
\cf1 \par
kick door\par
\cf2 The door is open\par
\cf0\fs16 \par
